Both line and radar charts support a fill option on the dataset object which can be used to create area between two datasets or a dataset and a boundary, i.e. the scale origin, start or end (see filling modes).~tGroup=Tooltip	Order=4	Style=SingleChoice	Label=Icon	Items=None (0)|Info (1)|Warning (2)|Error (3)	Values=0|1|2|3	Expression=true" tooltip.title="fill" tooltip.transparency="1" transparency="0" )
